  "bodyHash": "dEIjVZd/xfQ=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">永恒地狱(Eternal Nether)为Minecraft最炙热的维度再添烈焰——将这个燃烧的地下世界变成全新战场！探索堡垒般的猪灵庄园、高耸的要塞、以及闹鬼的地下墓穴，每个角落都潜伏着凶残的新生物，灰烬中埋藏着强大宝藏。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在这个比以往更鲜活也更致命的下界中，营救盟友、击败腐化敌人、谱写你的命运。新生物、新战利品、新方块——当然还有多得离谱的岩浆。带上最好的装备、最敏捷的身手，或许还得准备几瓶额外的抗火药水...你会用得上它们的！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏰 全新建筑</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏠 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">猪灵庄园</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：深藏绯红森林的宏伟宅邸，居住着身经百战的猪灵与凶猛的猪灵猎手</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">扭曲要塞</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：高耸于诡异森林之上的古老前哨，栖息着危险的腐化末影人</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">☠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋灵墓穴</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：形似凋灵的巨型遗迹，遍布致命的凋灵骷髅变种，等待发掘的秘密深藏其中</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚔️ 全新生物</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">猪灵猎手</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">手持盾牌与猎杀战利品</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔔 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">猪灵囚徒</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可用金锭与传说中的下界合金钟解救——他们会用</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">永不损坏的下界合金盾</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">回报英雄！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">扭曲末影人</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">会主动攻击——用剪刀分阶段净化它们！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">腐尸</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、🗡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋灵骷髅骑士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、🌫️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">幽魂</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">与👻 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">怨灵</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">为下界的黑暗长廊带来新挑战</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛠️ 全新装备与物品</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔔 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">下界合金钟</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：解救猪灵囚徒的必备物品</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">弯刀</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：拥有复古格挡机制的迅捷新武器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">下界合金盾</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：永不损坏且不会被重击禁用</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💿 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋灵圆舞曲唱片</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：为你的下界基地解锁诡异新旋律</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">扭曲末影珍珠</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：传送时获得防火、缓降等增益效果！</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧱 全新建筑方块</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🪨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋零黑石</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：完整方块系列，包括裂纹与装饰变种</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">☠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋零骨块</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、🪵 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋零煤块</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、🌋 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋零玄武岩</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">与🥶 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋零石英</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">系列方块</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">扭曲下界砖</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：经典下界砖的全新变体！</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌾 耕种强化</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🦴 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">凋零骨粉</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：超级肥料——效果远超普通骨粉！</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需在客户端与服务端同时安装</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">必须安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（FABRIC与NEOFORGE）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">必须安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">必须安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若模组支持配置，可通过游戏内的模组菜单直接调整（Fabric需安装</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，作者</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">）。注意旧版本Minecraft还需安装</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若需通过外部文本编辑器手动配置，所有文件均位于</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">目录，命名为</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，具体取决于配置类型。模组可能不存在某些配置类型。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特别感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/izofar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Izofar</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">原创的杰出模组</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bygone-nether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Bygone Nether</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。本模组是其作品的忠实延续，并进行了补充、改进、革新与漏洞修复。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tamlighter\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Tamlighter</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">创作诸多精美新材质。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/visualworkbench/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hang-glider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hangglider/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-anvils\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overflowing-bars\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sword-blocking-mechanics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/swordblockingmechanics/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cut-through\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/cutthrough/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/straw-statues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/strawstatues/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-infuser\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-age-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/goldenagecombat/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/metal-bundles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
